    {
      "entry": 29304,
      "name": "Slad'ran",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:29304:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:f3f066f82bbe3dc1ff80eefd",
            "source:44138c144c28eab428786dea",
            "source:7cdc725f975533371b53ea1e",
            "source:ad96d839d782ec840da214f7",
            "source:ee6da217bd79093bd63e9d49",
            "source:34ffa21e91c19751e8ba0be3"
          ],
          "text": "Slad'ran is the Drakkari High Prophet of Sseratus, encountered as a hostile Gundrak boss. He calls on snake minions and threatens trespassers; his taunts show contempt for intruders. In his final words, he recognizes that the Scourge was not the Drakkari's greatest enemy.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 29304
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "High Prophet of Sseratus"
    },
    {
      "entry": 29305,
      "name": "Moorabi",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:29305:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:0b5ddeb4b87a005ab8815382",
            "source:eab34f15a47212fe3f2ff660",
            "source:047be08951bb478bc4933cb6",
            "source:b0dad636cb3d8a4752ccde7e",
            "source:ad4d3163f0fe6bd9b57ba3b7",
            "source:f935d17c0679dd1dd1df0f04"
          ],
          "text": "Moorabi is the Drakkari High Prophet of Mam'toth and a hostile Gundrak boss. He boasts of fighting the Scourge, threatens to crush his opponents, and announces a transformation into something bigger. In death, he reflects that if the gods can die, so can the Drakkari.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 29305
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "High Prophet of Mam'toth"
    },
    {
      "entry": 29306,
      "name": "Gal'darah",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:29306:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:99f40f90c0800b0f8270b903",
            "source:7d8b7d8a3afd2884071ff86e",
            "source:b646875010c7722d69557632",
            "source:70e6ab8303515da08d5c3d1a",
            "source:cd0daad16136069a41e3728b",
            "source:91f26bcf4f02a92118aa64b3"
          ],
          "text": "Gal'darah is the Drakkari High Prophet of Akali and a hostile Gundrak boss. He summons a rhino and boasts that he and his people are gods. Tol'mar's account says Gal'darah killed Akali, and calls for vengeance; Gal'darah's final words acknowledge that even the mighty can fall.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 29306
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "High Prophet of Akali"
    },
